Changes made by Hybrowlabs (OPS-636), as required by section 4(b) of the licence:

  - Added openoutfind/providers/ (Lead Ocean, dataset file, and the selector).
  - Discovery now goes through the configured provider instead of BetterContact only:
    openoutfind/core/pipeline/walk.py, openoutfind/core/pipeline/discover.py.
  - New configuration fields and provider validation: openoutfind/core/config.py,
    openoutfind/core/readiness.py, openoutfind/core/status.py, openoutfind/core/cycle.py.
  - Upstream hub give-back and lookups are disabled unless discovery is BetterContact:
    openoutfind/contacts/service.py.
  - Tests: tests/test_providers.py, tests/conftest.py, tests/test_cycle.py,
    tests/test_readiness.py.
  - Publishing jobs do not run outside the upstream repository: .github/workflows/deploy.yml.
  - Documentation: README.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/configuration.md, NOTICE.

Upstream behaviour remains available by setting OPENOUTFIND_DISCOVERY_PROVIDER=bettercontact.
